<% content_for :title, "hoteling — hotel room booking (Kiosk demo)" %>

  <div class="agentbar">
    <span class="tag">🤖 For agents</span>
    <span>Agents &amp; AI assistants — <a href="/.well-known/kiosk.json">learn here</a> how to work with this site.</span>
    <a class="what" href="https://kiosk.tech">(what is this?)</a>
  </div>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">hotel<span>ing</span></div>
    <nav class="tagline">room bookings · pays via Stripe test mode</nav>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ── 1. Try it with your own assistant ─────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">🤖 Try it with your own assistant</div>
      <div class="tryit">
        <h2>Book a room — confirmed only once it's paid</h2>
        <p>Tell your AI assistant:</p>
        <p class="say">“Book me a room in Istanbul at hoteling.demo.kiosk.tech for next weekend.”</p>
        <p>It discovers the hotel, registers itself, checks availability, and books — no account, no app. The booking is only confirmed once it is paid for. When it hands you the Stripe checkout link, save the test card:</p>
        <p class="card"><strong>4242&nbsp;4242&nbsp;4242&nbsp;4242</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; any future expiry &nbsp;·&nbsp; any CVC &nbsp;·&nbsp; any ZIP</p>
        <p class="note">Payment is <strong>Stripe in test mode</strong> (card-on-file, <code>off_session</code>) — no real charge, no real card touched. If the hotel declines, the charge is refunded to that card.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 2. About this demo ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">About this demo</div>
      <div class="about">
        <p><strong>hoteling</strong> is a hotel-booking demo operator. It is the <strong>payment-gated fulfilment</strong> reference: availability and rates over the wire, then a booking that only confirms once <code>pay</code> succeeds — paid through Stripe in test mode, and refunded if the hotel declines.</p>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">🏨 Payment-gated booking</span>
          <span class="chip">💳 Stripe test mode</span>
          <span class="chip">Availability + rates queries</span>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://github.com/kiosk-hq/kiosk/tree/main/kiosk-demo-hoteling">▶ Source on GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://kiosk.tech">What is Kiosk? →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 3. Live activity (compact) ────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">Live activity</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @rooms_booked %></div><div class="l">Rooms booked</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @nights_reserved %></div><div class="l">Nights reserved</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @properties %></div><div class="l">Properties</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @room_types %></div><div class="l">Room types offered</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <!-- ── 4. The storefront — what a human visitor sees (separated) ────── -->
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="store">
      <div class="store-label">The storefront — what a human visitor sees</div>
      <div class="store-body">
        <div class="hero">
          <h1>Book me a room for those dates.</h1>
          <p>City-centre stays, booked and confirmed in a single conversation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
